  "frenzy": {
    "$comment": "Turn the Tables: every `charge` coins, the arena inverts for `duration` s. Hazards turn edible (lasers are cleared), spawning continues (new hazards arrive as prey), and each eat in a chain doubles in value up to `eatMax`. The last `warn` s blink as a warning; `grace` s of immunity follow so nothing ends a frenzy unfairly.",
